      "body": "Analysts have revised their price target on Brainbees Solutions from ₹414.00 to about ₹338.29, citing updated assumptions for discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin, and future P/E as the key drivers of this change. What's in the News Brainbees Solutions expanded its Qwik delivery service across select pincodes in Bengaluru, Pune, and Hyderabad, offering baby and kids' products delivered in less than 3 hours using its existing store network and RocketBees logistics (Key Developments).",
